# Experience quality

Premium product design is not decoration. It is the removal of uncertainty at every interaction.

This rule governs **behavior, clarity, feedback, and journey coherence**. It complements the creative-direction system (`design-principles.mdc`, design-memory) without replacing it. Visual art direction and experience quality are both required.

